/T (1. Objective To develop a full-stack web application that enables educational institutions to efficiently manage student information. The project provides hands-on experience in frontend development, backend development, database management, REST APIs, user authentication, and cloud deployment using the MERN Stack \(MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js\).)
/E (1. Objective To develop a full-stack web application that enables educational institutions to efficiently manage student information. The project provides hands-on experience in frontend development, backend development, database management, REST APIs, user authentication, and cloud deployment using the MERN Stack \(MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
