/T (2. Project Description The Student Management System is a web application that allows administrators and users to digitally manage student records. It supports registering new students, updating student information, searching and filtering records, and deleting records. The application includes secure user authentication, role-based access control \(Admin/User\), and a fully responsive interface that works across desktop and mobile devices.)
/E (2. Project Description The Student Management System is a web application that allows administrators and users to digitally manage student records. It supports registering new students, updating student information, searching and filtering records, and deleting records. The application includes secure user authentication, role-based access control \(Admin/User\), and a fully responsive interface that works across desktop and mobile devices.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
