/Title (5. Deployment Backend \(Render\): The Express.js server is deployed as a Web Service on Render, connected directly to the GitHub repository, with environment variables configured for the MongoDB connection string and JWT secret. Frontend \(Vercel\): The React application is deployed on Vercel, with the Root Directory set to the client folder and an environment variable pointing to the live backend API URL. Database \(MongoDB Atlas\): A cloud-hosted MongoDB cluster stores all user and student data in the 'studentDB' database, accessed securely from the backend.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 391 0 R
/Prev 416 0 R
